<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In DischargeSim: A Simulation Benchmark for Educational Doctor–Patient Communication at Discharge" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Related Work</span></a></li>
